# .git stays in the context ON PURPOSE: the `gitsha` stage of apps/api and apps/web2 reads the deployed
# commit from it (GET /version, task L16). No Dockerfile copies the whole context (`COPY . .`), so it never
# reaches an image. Do not add `COPY . .` to a Dockerfile without ignoring .git again.
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
.turbo
**/.turbo
README.md
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*keypair*.json
